  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "intro",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "(He's a shady character, what's his name?)",
          "rhyme": null,
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Oh wait now, got his card here",
          "rhyme": "eR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Yea I got it in my pocket, now, let me see",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Oh yes, here it is",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "(DOOM... I see)",
          "rhyme": null,
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "MF DOOM: It ain't nuttin' like, Hip Hop music",
          "rhyme": "ik",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCDAE",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABCDAC"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "It ain't nuttin' like a fist full of cash or a bliss full of the hash",
          "rhyme": "aS",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "That twist like a mustache, from end to end, spread it like a rash",
          "rhyme": "aS",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "From talkin' through your Walkman or at your disco bash",
          "rhyme": "aS",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Give me the Timbs Rumpelstiltskin brown",
          "rhyme": "awn",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "A metal face mask with a built in frown",
          "rhyme": "awn",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "A mic to tilt down, a hundred thousand pounds",
          "rhyme": "wndz",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "And see how kilt sound like spilt milk clown",
          "rhyme": "un",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Cocoa butter on very ashy day, fam",
          "rhyme": "im",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "With Ray-Bans out on the islands of Cayman",
          "rhyme": "an",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Or I'll break it down for the layman",
          "rhyme": "an",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Bain De Soleil for the Saint-Tropez... tannnn",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "A can a old gold, too cold to hold, slow your roll",
          "rhyme": "Ol",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Keep on movin' like Soul II Soul",
          "rhyme": "ul",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Hold the dough like a fool who stole pity y'all",
          "rhyme": "ol",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "From tryna go up against city hall titty bar",
          "rhyme": "aR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "The black mic is like a red violin",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "Okay, everybody back to the lab, try again",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "Bloody rap game like Leviathan",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "Leave a bad taste, killin' my high like Niacin",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "Stop kiddin' middlemen need Ritalin",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "Hit me with the full tin of gin and I'm a kid again",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "Keep the bong lightin' straight through the song writin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "The Supervillain AKA the thong bitin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "Is invitin' all to the recitin' that's dope and raw",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "Hopin' all y'all come in peace and it's open bar",
          "rhyme": "aR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "Tear the roof off this Bumba Ras Clot",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "By the end of the night, spazz like Shazbot",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "27",
          "text": "I spilt a shot, made the pen lines runny",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "28",
          "text": "An ill plot that's ten times Ben Stein’s money",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "29",
          "text": "Funny how he rip scripts with a straight face",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "30",
          "text": "With more rhymes than is lines in your database",
          "rhyme": "az",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "31",
          "text": "Placin' rappers in endangerment, who's reckless",
          "rhyme": "Es",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "32",
          "text": "With this food for thought sort of like breakfast",
          "rhyme": "9st",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "33",
          "text": "You could mark it off as wreck on the checklist",
          "rhyme": "ist",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "34",
          "text": "Wear gold fronts, can't afford no necklace",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "35",
          "text": "Shit, that ten could go to help buildin' daycares",
          "rhyme": "aR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "36",
          "text": "Somebody say yeah (yeah!)",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "37",
          "text": "Pay your fares, give the Herbalisers their shares",
          "rhyme": "aR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "38",
          "text": "And y'all could pay DOOM in beers, cheers!",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "AAABBCDEFFGHIJKLLMLLLLLNKNNOPQRSTUQKPKV",
